  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Monterey, CA\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Monterey, CA\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nMonterey, CA\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n831.899.4838\n2200 Garden Road #101\nMonterey, CA 93940\n[email protected]\ninstagram.com/bluepearlmonterey\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nWe’ve moved!\nOur new, upgraded hospital is now located at 2200 Garden Rd. #101, Monterey, CA 93940.\nThank you for your patience so we can better serve you and your pets!\nBluePearl Pet Hospital in Monterey County.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital in Monterey serves patients, clients and primary veterinarians from San Luis Obispo to Santa Cruz to Monterey counties and beyond.\nOur services.\nOur experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nThe expert veterinarians and staff at our hospital are trained to handle emergencies 24/7.\nIn an emergency, please call ahead and let us know you’re coming. There is no appointment necessary for your emergency vet visit.\nSpecialty care\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospital in Monterey, we provide advanced medical and surgical services for ill and injured pets. Our team of board-certified specialists and specialty clinicians are highly skilled and committed to providing your pet with the best medical care.\nThrough every step of your pet’s specialty care process, we communicate closely with both you and your pet’s primary veterinarian. Your pet’s quality of life is our top priority.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Monterey.\nFormerly known as Pet Specialists of Monterey, our hospital uses the latest and most advanced equipment to provide top-notch care for your pet.\nEmergency history.\nPlease\ndownload this PDF\nand send the completed form to\n[email protected]\n.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n831.899.4838\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n831.899.4838\n2200 Garden Road                                    #101\nMonterey,\nCA                                    93940\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nFresno, CA\n7375 N Palm Bluffs Ave.\nFresno, CA 93711\n559.437.3766\n114.86 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nReno, NV\n555 Morrill Ave.\nReno, NV 89512\n775.358.8555\n232.40 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nStudio City\nLos Angeles, CA\n11730 Ventura Blvd\nStudio City, CA 91604\n818.760.3882\n258.31 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
